+    indexer tensor with the indexer's block stride (38016 B for GLM-5.3-Flash
+    at 1152-token blocks vs a dense 2048 B tail block), so a seed kernel that
+    addresses blocks densely writes into an unrelated indexer block and leaves
+    the request's tail block untouched.
